      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Scarred Grove [zone=1381]\n**Who:**\n- Commander Roknik [ _Quest Giver_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 115\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Innoruuk Battle Plans [item=153175]\n- Innoruuk Camp Supplies [item=153179]\n**Era:** | !Shattering of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Nov 30 22:01:45 2025\nModified: Tue Dec 9 06:37:57 2025 | | **Prerequisite Task:** Through the Breach [quest=13699]\n\n---\n\nThis partisan task can be obtain from Commander Roknik in Scarred Grove. He is at the Rallos Zek camp in the south part of the zone. He is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Commander Roknik'\nCommander Roknik frowns deeply. \"Me not believe Innoruuk troops betray us, they too coward. They told to secure tunnels for supplies. I still not trust them though. I send [lieutenant] to oversee and make sure they do what told.\"\nYou say, 'Have you heard from this lieutenant recently?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Sending a Message'.\nCommander Roknik shakes head. \"No, he late with supplies. That why I send you. You look tough and look like need work. You go check, talk to Lieutenant Norb, make sure supply paths [secure].\"\nYou say, 'What if they are not secure?'\nCommander Roknik says, 'Then you get supplies and give them to Lieutenant Lunk. If betrayal, then bring back proof to me.'\n\n---\n\nCommander Roknik does not believe the Innoruuk forces are brave enough to betray Rallos Zek, but the supplies they have been expecting are running late. So, he wants you to go to the tunnels, collect the supplies, and check in with the lieutenant he placed in charge.\nSpeak with Lieutenant Norb.\n1\\. Speak with Lieutenant Norb in the tunnels 0/1 Scarred Grove\nThe underground tunnel can be accessed at /way -1510, -1277, -78 or at -906, -1209, -27 thru the fake wall.\nThis is a location update in the tunnel at /way -1453, -1594, -120 not far from the entrance of the tunnel on the southeast entrance. You'll see the Lieutenant Norb's corpse laying on the ground.\n2\\. Inspect Lieutenant Norb's body 0/1 Scarred Grove\nTarget his corpse and /inspect\nYour task 'Sending a Message' has been updated.\n3\\. Collect supplies from the Innoruuk tunnels 0/3 Scarred Grove\nThese are the cardboard boxes you see laying on the ground, click on them. Each member of the group needs to loot.\n4\\. Collect Innoruuk's battleplans 0/1 Scarred Grove\nThis is in the square room at /way -1067, -1630, -131. The battleplans are on the barrel in the back right of the room at /way -1055, -1661, -125. Each person in the group will need to loot one. It respawns quick.\nInnoruuk Battle Plans (Itemid 113512)\n5\\. Deliver supplies to Lieutenant Lunk 0/3 Scarred Grove\nYou offered 1 Innoruuk Camp Supplies to Lieutenant Lunk.\nYou offered 1 Innoruuk Camp Supplies to Lieutenant Lunk.\nYou offered 1 Innoruuk Camp Supplies to Lieutenant Lunk.\nYour task 'Sending a Message' has been updated.\nLieutenant Lunk takes the supplies. \"This help crush enemies.\"\nYour task 'Sending a Message' has been updated.\nLieutenant Lunk takes the supplies. \"This help crush enemies.\"\nYour task 'Sending a Message' has been updated.\nLieutenant Lunk takes the supplies. \"This help crush enemies.\"\nYou complete the trade with Lieutenant Lunk.\n6\\. Deliver Innoruuk's battleplans to Commander Roknik 0/1 Scarred Grove\nYou offered 1 Innoruuk Battle Plans to Commander Roknik.\nYour task 'Sending a Message' has been updated.\nCommander Roknik crumples the plans in his hand making a fist. \"These cowards think make fool of us? We show them. You send a [message].\"\nYou complete the trade with Commander Roknik.\n7\\. Send a message of violence to Innoruuk's forces 0/10 Scarred Grove\nGo back to the tunnel.\nMobs that count:\na corpse golem\na hateful chaplain\na loathsome blade\na vile ghast\na wretched abomination\nI think anything in the tunnel counts.\n8\\. Destroy Innoruuk's war banner 0/5 Scarred Grove\nYou'll see these scattered thru the tunnel. It's a red long flag with a wolf at the top, waving in the wind. Kill them.\nThey respawn quickly.\n9\\. Return to Commander Roknik 0/1 Scarred Grove\nYou say, 'Hail, Commander Roknik'\nCommander Roknik glowers as you approach. \"You fill tunnel with [betrayer] blood and smoke?\"\nYou say, 'betrayer'\nYour task 'Sending a Message' has been updated.\nCommander Roknik glower turns to a sinister smile. \"You do good then, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Now that message sent and tunnels full of blood you go speak with healer. She keep sending people asking for you and I get tired of hitting them.\"\n10\\. Speak with Quellious 0/1 Scarred Grove\nYou say, 'Hail, Quellious'\nYour task 'Sending a Message' has been updated.\nThe conflict continues between the Verdant Guardians and the Burning Host, but with the betrayal of Innoruuk's forces and the host's supply lines being less than secure the invaders have a lot of work to do before they can claim victory.\nYour faction standing with The Burning Host has been adjusted by 225.\nYour faction standing with Verdant Guardians could not possibly get any worse.\nYou receive 36 platinum .\nYou gain experience\nQuellious looks up at you a concerned look on her face. \"Thank you for coming to speak with me, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. We have much to discuss.\"\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nMoney - At Level 130 - 36 platinum\nExperience\nIncreases your faction with The Burning Host.\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
